# graphify corpus exclusions (gitignore syntax), scoped to the SimFlow plugin.
#
# The project root has its own .graphifyignore for the whole-project graph.
# This one applies when graphify is run from inside Plugins/SimFlow, which
# produces a clean plugin-only corpus with no UHT reflection glue.

# Unreal build output
/Binaries
/Intermediate

# graphify's own output (already skipped internally; listed for clarity)
/graphify-out

# NOTE: /docs, README.md and CHANGELOG.md are deliberately NOT excluded.
# They carry the design rationale the graph needs to answer "why" questions.
